{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00367","headline":"和题丹景山至德寺 · 蜀太妃徐氏","name":"和题丹景山至德寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹景山头宿梵宫，玉轮金辂驻虚空。\n军持无水注寒碧，兰若有花开晚红。\n武士尽排青嶂下，内人皆在讲筵中。\n我家帝子传王业，积善终期四海同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蜀太妃徐氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}